#: src/kernel/firecracker.md:55
msgid ""
"The `rdinit=/bin/sh` kernel parameter in `boot_args` selects the init "
"program to run as the first userspace process; here it starts a BusyBox "
"shell on the serial console. Omitting `rdinit` boots the default initramfs `/"
"init` instead."
msgstr ""

